<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ISRO Scientist/Engineer 'SC' — Mock Test Series</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="site-head">
    <div class="mark">ICRB·26</div>
    <div class="head-text">
      <h1>Scientist/Engineer &lsquo;SC&rsquo; Mock Test Series</h1>
      <p>Practice sets built to the exact ISRO ICRB:03(EMC):2026 pattern — 80 discipline questions in 90 minutes, 15 aptitude questions in 30 minutes, negative marking included.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="pattern-strip" aria-label="Exam pattern reference">
    <div class="pattern-block">
      <span class="pattern-label">Part A — Discipline</span>
      <span class="pattern-value">80 Q · 90 min · 80 marks</span>
      <span class="pattern-sub">+1 correct · &minus;1/3 wrong</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pattern-block">
      <span class="pattern-label">Part B — Aptitude</span>
      <span class="pattern-value">15 Q · 30 min · 20 marks</span>
      <span class="pattern-sub">no negative marking</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pattern-block">
      <span class="pattern-label">Qualifying</span>
      <span class="pattern-value">50% each part</span>
      <span class="pattern-sub">40% each — PwBD reserved posts</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main>
    <section class="discipline" id="electronics">
      <h2>Electronics &amp; Communication <span class="post-code">BE001</span></span></h2>
      <div class="test-grid" data-discipline="electronics"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="discipline" id="mechanical">
      <h2>Mechanical Engineering <span class="post-code">BE002</span></h2>
      <div class="test-grid" data-discipline="mechanical"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="discipline" id="cs">
      <h2>Computer Science Engineering <span class="post-code">BE003</span></h2>
      <div class="test-grid" data-discipline="cs"></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-foot">
    <p>Unofficial practice material. Not affiliated with ISRO or ICRB. Refer to <a href="https://www.isro.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">isro.gov.in</a> for the official advertisement and FAQs.</p>
  </footer>

</div>
<script src="assets/catalog.js"></script>
<script src="assets/home.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
